<title>USA: Oshkosh Truck gets $46.3 mln Army order.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh Truck gets $46.3 mln Army order.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oshkosh Truck Corp said Thursday the U.S. Army purchased 187 additional vehicles, worth $46.3 million, as options to an existing contract for heavy equipment transporters.</p>
</text>
